<p>A punch to the body that deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">141%, 154%, 164%, 172%, 180%</acronym> damage, drains <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 6, 8, 10</acronym> of the target's stamina per combo point, and dazes the target for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym> to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns, depending on the amount of combo points you've accumulated.</p><p>The daze chance will increase with your Physical Power.</p><p>Using this talent removes your combo points.</p>